WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.670
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:33.530 --> 00:01:34.180
Our competition

00:01:34.230 --> 00:01:35.950
with Dark Cooking Society

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:38.270
goes to Round 3.

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:39.170
At present, we're ahead with one win and one draw.

00:01:39.520 --> 00:01:40.790
Now, Lei En is competing with

00:01:40.850 --> 00:01:43.270
Xiang En who also has the Seven-Star Knives

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:44.880
on the Shanghai Crab.

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:49.290
Xiang En cooked the ordinary Lotus Egg

00:01:49.450 --> 00:01:50.860
and the crab soup

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:53.150
while Lei En made

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:56.170
the perfect Fried Crab.

00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:00.690
But

00:02:01.210 --> 00:02:02.200
why do I feel so upset?

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:04.580
Why does it taste so bad?

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:09.530
Smash the Evil Blade! Soul of the Seven-Star Knives!s

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:12.490
How could Lei En's cooking

00:02:17.050 --> 00:02:19.010
taste bad?

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:22.470
Darn it. It tastes awful.

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:24.540
I really can't swallow a mouthful.

00:02:24.730 --> 00:02:26.140
How dare you, Lei En.

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:27.930
Such junk food doesn't deserve comments.

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:30.760
What the hell is going on?

00:02:31.090 --> 00:02:32.080
Seven-Star Knives Lei En

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:33.790
is scolded

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:35.160
by the judges

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:36.850
for his perfect Crab.

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:39.770
There is no doubt that

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:43.590
the winner of

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:45.850
Shanghai Crab Duel

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:49.390
in Round 3

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:50.960
is Ten Feet of Blue Xiang En.

00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:58.000
I think all of you should have no objection.

00:03:02.470 --> 00:03:05.670
The winner is Xiang En.

00:03:09.490 --> 00:03:10.120
How could it be?

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:11.160
In any case,

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:12.980
Lei En's crab should be better.

00:03:13.280 --> 00:03:14.310
Are you willing to swear

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:17.150
that no matter what happens,

00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:19.610
you won't change your decision?

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:21.520
Of course.

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:23.110
Darn it.

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:26.460
This is clearly a honey trap.

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:28.710
The judges have all fallen for her honey trap.

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:29.370
How else would they

00:03:29.420 --> 00:03:31.240
make such unjust decision?

00:03:31.630 --> 00:03:33.140
How could Lei En's Fried Crab Bucket

00:03:33.180 --> 00:03:35.150
lose to Xiang En's Crab Meat Egg?

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:36.240
Right.

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:38.450
Why don't you do a fair review?

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:39.240
Mr. Zhang,

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:42.180
about Lei En's Crab Bucket,

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:43.860
you just said it tastes bad.

00:03:44.110 --> 00:03:45.580
This is too unconvincing.

00:03:45.980 --> 00:03:47.390
Enough. Don't go too far.

00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:49.560
Like what I said at the beginning,

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:52.550
our responsibility is very clear,

00:03:53.470 --> 00:03:55.360
that is, to choose the better dish.

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:56.580
It's just that.

00:03:56.950 --> 00:03:58.180
Well...

00:03:58.280 --> 00:04:00.060
What you said is simple,

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:01.830
but it's not convincing at all.

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:03.330
You'll see after eating.

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:04.150
Eat it yourself.

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:06.140
That's right.

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:08.950
Yeah, we'll see after eating.

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:21.440
Fill in crab shells with crab meat.

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:24.110
And then fry them until they're golden and crispy.

00:04:24.770 --> 00:04:27.340
At last season with crab brains and crab roe.

00:04:28.850 --> 00:04:31.030
(Delicious)
The delicacy of Shanghai Crab is all concentrated in it.

00:04:31.900 --> 00:04:34.130
It's so delicious.

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:38.780
Take a bit of

00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:41.090
the fried golden crispy crab shell,

00:04:41.470 --> 00:04:43.090
and enjoy its delicacy

00:04:43.140 --> 00:04:45.060
in an instant.

00:04:45.270 --> 00:04:46.160
Like a great river,

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:47.850
it takes people to a paradise of bliss.

00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:48.970
It is exactly the great river of crabs.

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:52.980
The crab's simply impeccable.

00:04:57.960 --> 00:05:00.600
This is the ultimate delicacy.

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:02.220
Lei En even

00:05:02.270 --> 00:05:03.430
took out the meat

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:06.930
in the crab claws.

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:08.640
The crab shells are fried just right.

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:09.490
It's so crispy.

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:10.590
This is a demonstration

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:12.660
of Lei En's delicate technique

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:14.440
and sincerity.

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:16.650
What did you say?

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:18.320
What are they talking about?

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:20.080
You're obviously laughing at us.

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:21.860
We don't believe

00:05:21.950 --> 00:05:23.390
Xiang En's Crab Meat Egg

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:24.550
is more delicious than Lei En's Crab Bucket.

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:25.990
Well, Sister,

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:28.040
let's try her crab meat egg.

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:34.320
Why does she look so confident?

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:36.260
What will happen?

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:37.640
Does Xiang En's Lotus Egg

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:38.570
really surpass

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:40.180
Lei En's Crab Bucket?

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:45.600
It tastes good.

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:48.010
But there's nothing special about it.

00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:49.040
Any veteran chef

00:05:49.090 --> 00:05:50.690
can cook

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:51.440
this dish.

00:05:52.970 --> 00:05:53.960
Hey, old man.

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:55.450
Something is wrong.

00:05:55.680 --> 00:05:56.420
I think

00:05:56.470 --> 00:05:58.410
there is something wrong with you.

00:05:58.460 --> 00:05:59.010
What...

00:05:59.240 --> 00:06:00.270
What are you saying, kid?

00:06:00.650 --> 00:06:01.540
You say it again.

00:06:02.220 --> 00:06:03.340
I can say as many times as you wish.

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:05.420
There is something wrong with your tongues.

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:06.360
There must be a problem.

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:07.640
Stop lying.

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:08.910
The result is decided.

00:06:09.020 --> 00:06:10.150
Shut up, kid.

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:11.180
Yeah, shut up.

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:12.950
I'm not lying.

00:06:13.090 --> 00:06:14.270
What I said is true.

00:06:14.320 --> 00:06:15.410
If you don't believe me, just try it yourself.

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:16.560
Yes. Yes.

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:17.930
Are you kidding me?

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:19.180
How could we lie?

00:06:19.630 --> 00:06:20.840
We judge the dishes

00:06:20.930 --> 00:06:22.290
by our true feelings.

00:06:23.140 --> 00:06:24.380
Yeah, right.

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:29.380
Who is telling the truth?

00:06:29.640 --> 00:06:31.830
Who is lying?

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:33.530
In fact, both sides are telling the truth.

00:06:42.110 --> 00:06:43.050
Mao.

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:48.520
Isn't that the crab soup?

00:06:49.030 --> 00:06:49.570
Soup?

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:51.040
Is it because of the soup?

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:53.110
That's right, Lei En.

00:06:53.520 --> 00:06:55.790
This soup is the key to the trick.

00:06:58.300 --> 00:06:59.230
Ten Feet of Blue Xiang En.

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:02.800
You are so mean and shameless.

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:04.970
What the hell is going on?

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:05.730
Drink it, Silang.

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:06.620
Drink it all.

00:07:07.970 --> 00:07:10.560
You ask me to drink the soup?

00:07:19.940 --> 00:07:21.650
This crab soup is really fragrant.

00:07:21.760 --> 00:07:23.020
The essence of the crab shell

00:07:23.070 --> 00:07:24.240
is melt completely into the soup.

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:26.170
Though it tastes good,

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:27.770
it's still far behind

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:29.180
Lei En's Fried Crab Bucket.

00:07:29.690 --> 00:07:31.510
Silang, now eat

00:07:31.560 --> 00:07:32.760
the Crab Bucket.

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:35.220
No matter how much I eat,

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:37.280
it always tastes great.

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:38.680
Do as I say. Eat it.

00:07:40.610 --> 00:07:42.540
Got it.

00:07:42.680 --> 00:07:44.900
I'm going to eat it.

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:47.810
Why are you so angry?

00:07:52.170 --> 00:07:54.650
Why does it taste so bad?

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:55.270
What did you say?

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:56.420
Silang.

00:07:58.860 --> 00:08:01.680
I can't taste the crab at all.

00:08:01.730 --> 00:08:03.570
Seems I ate

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:04.610
something soft and slimy

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:06.650
with the greasy and disgusting smell.

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:08.840
It's hard to swallow at all.

00:08:08.890 --> 00:08:09.750
How could it be?

00:08:10.280 --> 00:08:10.870
Didn't you just

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:12.550
eat every mouthful with great enjoyment?

00:08:13.030 --> 00:08:14.620
What the hell is going on?

00:08:14.910 --> 00:08:15.920
How could the same dish

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:17.190
taste completely different?

00:08:17.860 --> 00:08:19.620
The Lotus Egg is just a red herring.

00:08:19.940 --> 00:08:20.920
The judges were all

00:08:21.050 --> 00:08:23.040
trapped by the crab soup.

00:08:23.340 --> 00:08:24.600
Is there anything special

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:26.200
in the soup?

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:30.340
No, this is definitely crab soup.

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:31.190
But

00:08:33.220 --> 00:08:34.520
it was made with crashed crab shells,

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:35.870
a super soup,

00:08:35.970 --> 00:08:38.210
much thicker than

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:40.160
the ordinary crab soup.

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:41.990
I see.

00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:43.840
But what does it have to do

00:08:43.890 --> 00:08:44.970
with Lei En's Crab Bucket?

00:08:45.860 --> 00:08:46.480
For example,

00:08:46.820 --> 00:08:48.520
if you eat ordinary curry

00:08:48.680 --> 00:08:49.910
after super spicy curry,

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:51.600
you won't have any spicy taste.

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:54.220
Similarly,

00:08:55.030 --> 00:08:55.790
after eating

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:57.440
this thick crab soup,

00:08:57.490 --> 00:08:58.540
you'll have a weak sense of taste.

00:08:58.920 --> 00:09:00.280
Then no matter how delicious the crab is,

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:02.230
you won't taste it.

00:09:04.030 --> 00:09:05.340
I see.

00:09:05.470 --> 00:09:07.360
I totally get it now.

00:09:07.590 --> 00:09:08.560
So

00:09:08.600 --> 00:09:09.700
even though eating the Crab Bucket,

00:09:09.810 --> 00:09:11.740
the judges can't taste it at all.

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:14.310
They just feel that it is too greasy.

00:09:16.190 --> 00:09:17.020
Let me be clear.

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:18.720
Lei En's Crab Bucket

00:09:18.770 --> 00:09:19.560
is the best in the whole country.

00:09:19.690 --> 00:09:22.080
No. Even anywhere in the world,

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:22.790
it can absolutely

00:09:22.840 --> 00:09:24.770
get the highest rating.

00:09:25.770 --> 00:09:27.240
But ironically,

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:28.470
the more delicious

00:09:28.870 --> 00:09:29.510
the Crab Bucket is

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:31.300
the lower the rating is.

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:33.500
Because Xiang En had come up with the plan

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:36.210
after knowing that

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:37.720
Lei En was going to cook the fried Crab Bucket.

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:44.040
She has no desire to pursue the delicious food.

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:45.780
All she wants is to

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:47.840
knock her rival down.

00:09:59.060 --> 00:09:59.990
An aboveboard chef

00:10:00.040 --> 00:10:01.380
will never do such a thing.

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:03.010
She is so mean.

00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:05.080
You're really from Dark Cooking Society.

00:10:05.260 --> 00:10:06.090
What a witch!

00:10:07.140 --> 00:10:08.780
You deserve to be a Super Chef.

00:10:08.900 --> 00:10:10.500
No wonder you can figure the trick out,

00:10:10.550 --> 00:10:11.480
the taste fatigue.

00:10:11.480 --> 00:10:12.400
(Taste Fatigue)

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:14.160
But the result can't be changed.

00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:18.500
All the judges have just taken an oath.

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:25.640
It's really Dark Cooking Society.

00:10:25.800 --> 00:10:28.210
Even if her trick is seen through by the Super Chef,

00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:29.810
Ten Feet of Blue Xiang En

00:10:29.860 --> 00:10:30.680
is still the winner.

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:32.220
Beauty, you are really awesome.

00:10:32.300 --> 00:10:34.490
A win is a win.

00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:36.550
I'm too careless.

00:10:39.090 --> 00:10:40.740
Even though you're brilliant

00:10:40.920 --> 00:10:41.920
you're so naive

00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:44.150
and defeated by such a simple trick.

00:10:46.010 --> 00:10:49.290
Lei En who once killed Roger for success

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:51.060
failed like this.

00:10:53.620 --> 00:10:54.280
You don't deserve

00:10:54.330 --> 00:10:56.780
the Seven-Star Knives.

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:01.340
Lei En.

00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:05.530
Sorry, guys.

00:11:06.110 --> 00:11:07.400
To destroy Dark Cooking Society,

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:08.720
I left here.

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:11.680
But today, I lost completely.

00:11:14.070 --> 00:11:14.590
Lei En.

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:17.760
Now you become a loser

00:11:18.270 --> 00:11:18.970
with no place to go.

00:11:19.010 --> 00:11:20.550
Roger's blood on your hands

00:11:20.680 --> 00:11:22.270
is exactly the mark of a loser.

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.940
It turns out I'm not qualified to

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:33.720
possess the Seven-Star Knives,

00:11:34.190 --> 00:11:36.670
let alone being a top chef.

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:38.580
Lei En.

00:11:40.690 --> 00:11:41.360
Lei En.

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:49.950
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:54.490 --> 00:11:57.730
Am I really not qualified to possess the Seven-Star Knives?

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:00.660
Please tell me, Roger.

00:12:01.100 --> 00:12:03.170
That's it, Lei En.

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:08.940
This Seven-Star Knife

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:10.040
was made with the resentment of Roger

00:12:10.090 --> 00:12:12.110
who was killed by you.

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:19.280
He must be happy to finally get his revenge.

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:21.760
There should be only one person in the world

00:12:21.810 --> 00:12:22.570
possessing the Seven-Star Knives.

00:12:23.190 --> 00:12:25.680
That's me, Ten Feet of Blue Xiang En.

00:12:26.420 --> 00:12:27.120
Hold on.

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:32.130
You're really an unscrupulous woman.

00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:35.000
That's exactly what you want.

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:37.440
I finally know

00:12:38.720 --> 00:12:39.540
why you also have

00:12:39.590 --> 00:12:41.370
a set of Seven-Star Knives

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:44.060
that shouldn't exist in the world.

00:12:45.520 --> 00:12:46.980
Chef Xie, what's the matter?

00:12:47.400 --> 00:12:49.780
Why does Xiang En have the Seven-Star Knives?

00:12:50.170 --> 00:12:50.630
Listen up!

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:52.260
This set of Seven-Star Knives

00:12:52.400 --> 00:12:54.710
is the unique masterpiece

00:12:55.090 --> 00:12:57.280
of Maker Roger.

00:12:58.030 --> 00:12:59.490
A year ago,

00:12:59.860 --> 00:13:01.320
Lei En who went astray killed Roger

00:13:01.370 --> 00:13:03.200
after the Seven-Star Knives were finished,

00:13:06.020 --> 00:13:09.030
to keep Roger

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:10.260
from making a better knife.

00:13:12.650 --> 00:13:14.800
But if that's the case,

00:13:14.950 --> 00:13:16.380
there shouldn't be another set

00:13:16.430 --> 00:13:17.850
of Seven-Star Knives.

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:21.170
Didn't I told you?

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:22.610
This Seven-Star Knife

00:13:22.660 --> 00:13:23.690
was made with the resentment of Roger

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:25.680
who was killed by Lei En.

00:13:25.940 --> 00:13:27.240
How could such a thing happen?

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:29.650
Roger

00:13:30.390 --> 00:13:31.130
didn't die.

00:13:33.720 --> 00:13:34.680
He didn't.

00:13:36.690 --> 00:13:37.930
What do you mean, Chef Xie?

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:40.150
Actually, if I remember correctly,

00:13:40.300 --> 00:13:42.040
when I was wandering,

00:13:42.220 --> 00:13:43.410
I once met Roger.

00:13:44.850 --> 00:13:45.560
Roger.

00:13:47.270 --> 00:13:49.700
At that time, Roger once said,

00:13:53.260 --> 00:13:54.410
as a Maker of Knife,

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:57.360
when he finished his best work of his life,

00:13:57.880 --> 00:13:59.870
he must make another one exactly the same

00:14:00.370 --> 00:14:01.240
with a grateful heart

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:02.800
and dedicate it to the Divinity.

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:05.350
Only he knows

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:07.010
the place where the knife is placed.

00:14:07.480 --> 00:14:09.200
He won't tell anyone until he dies.

00:14:11.970 --> 00:14:12.610
I see.

00:14:12.780 --> 00:14:14.650
No wonder there are two sets of Seven-Star Knives.

00:14:15.320 --> 00:14:17.000
That's right.

00:14:17.050 --> 00:14:19.140
That's the other set.

00:14:19.660 --> 00:14:20.560
Am I right, vixen?

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:22.750
It just occurred to me.

00:14:23.070 --> 00:14:24.980
Under the cliff next to Roger's workshop

00:14:25.030 --> 00:14:26.300
was thick weeds.

00:14:27.460 --> 00:14:28.780
So if

00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:30.050
Roger fell on the weeds,

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:33.380
he didn't die then.

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:38.620
Lei En…

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:43.360
You were the one who showed up.

00:14:43.590 --> 00:14:44.270
Ten Feet of Blue Xiang En.

00:14:45.800 --> 00:14:46.720
I heard that Dark Cooking Society

00:14:46.770 --> 00:14:47.750
is well versed in

00:14:47.960 --> 00:14:49.520
medicine and witchcraft

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:51.810
You're an expert in this regard.

00:14:51.940 --> 00:14:52.730
Right, Xiang En?

00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:54.410
It's Confession Sword.

00:14:54.940 --> 00:14:57.740
Wandering men are really annoying.

00:14:57.940 --> 00:14:58.370
I can't believe

00:14:58.420 --> 00:15:00.540
you met Roger.

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:31.600
Where were the Seven-Star Knives?

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:36.220
Dragon Cave.

00:15:44.620 --> 00:15:47.350
You chose Lei En rather than Mao

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:48.230
as your rival

00:15:48.530 --> 00:15:49.330
in order to make yourself

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:51.070
as the sole owner of the Seven-Star Knives.

00:15:51.810 --> 00:15:53.170
You used Lei En's simple

00:15:53.290 --> 00:15:55.850
but strong personality

00:15:56.360 --> 00:15:57.680
to induce him to give up

00:15:57.770 --> 00:15:58.620
his Seven-Star Knives.

00:15:58.670 --> 00:15:59.420
Am I right?

00:16:00.340 --> 00:16:02.390
But if that's the case,

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:03.430
Roger..

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:05.650
Roger would still be alive.

00:16:14.190 --> 00:16:16.830
I'm not as naive as you, Lei En.

00:16:17.460 --> 00:16:17.980
Is he...

00:16:22.900 --> 00:16:25.280
I killed him myself.

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:32.930
What?

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:35.330
You have lived with the sense of guilt

00:16:35.370 --> 00:16:38.160
for not knowing the truth.

00:16:40.330 --> 00:16:42.570
You are a cruel woman.

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:45.310
The sharp knives

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:46.440
with sharp cutting edge

00:16:46.490 --> 00:16:47.710
belong to me.

00:16:48.030 --> 00:16:49.790
I will not allow anyone else to have them.

00:16:53.920 --> 00:16:54.840
Go to die.

00:16:59.090 --> 00:17:01.430
Let me send you to see Roger.

00:17:03.610 --> 00:17:04.290
Lei En.

00:17:04.340 --> 00:17:05.100
Stop it!

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:09.520
Stop it. Lei En.

00:17:10.590 --> 00:17:11.990
Yeah, come on.

00:17:12.530 --> 00:17:13.770
Come on, beauty.

00:17:29.590 --> 00:17:30.280
What's going on?

00:17:31.710 --> 00:17:32.700
What is the ray of light?

00:17:43.640 --> 00:17:44.380
Roger.

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:50.240
Is this…

00:17:50.410 --> 00:17:51.350
A phantom?

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:54.410
What the hell is going on?

00:17:55.150 --> 00:17:56.570
Yeah, what the hell is this?

00:17:57.810 --> 00:17:58.560
Lei En.

00:17:59.130 --> 00:18:00.890
Why do you use a Seven-Star Knife

00:18:00.940 --> 00:18:02.820
for other purposes rather than cooking?

00:18:04.530 --> 00:18:07.660
The Big Dipper is the God of life and death.

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:08.990
I gave the Seven-Star Knives

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:10.810
the sacred and lofty mission,

00:18:11.460 --> 00:18:12.940
hoping to sublimate the life of materials

00:18:12.990 --> 00:18:15.070
to people's life.

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:17.160
You should use

00:18:17.210 --> 00:18:18.640
this sacred, sharp knife

00:18:19.290 --> 00:18:21.680
to bring more happiness to people.

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:24.730
Since that day,

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:26.910
regret is always with you.

00:18:27.320 --> 00:18:28.090
This is by no means

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:29.650
the mission

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:31.460
of the Seven-Star Knives.

00:18:32.870 --> 00:18:34.870
I hope you can use them

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:37.410
to serve your dishes

00:18:38.230 --> 00:18:40.320
for every new life.

00:19:01.290 --> 00:19:02.210
It's impossible.

00:19:06.590 --> 00:19:08.670
How could my Seven-Star Knife become like this?

00:19:10.100 --> 00:19:11.580
Lei En's Seven Star Knife.

00:19:14.340 --> 00:19:14.910
Yes.

00:19:15.640 --> 00:19:17.310
This is the answer

00:19:17.570 --> 00:19:19.630
from Roger whose soul

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:20.740
is on the two sets.

00:19:22.860 --> 00:19:25.760
The Seven-Star Knives can grow by itself.

00:19:26.570 --> 00:19:27.490
As the owner of the Seven-Star Knives

00:19:27.920 --> 00:19:29.870
brings happiness to people,

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:33.030
the Seven-star Knives will grow accordingly,

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:34.130
the light will be more dazzling

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:35.870
and the knife edge will be sharper.

00:19:36.680 --> 00:19:39.060
Right. What Lei En did was

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:40.670
recognized by Roger's soul.

00:19:41.300 --> 00:19:43.060
Despite of being tortured,

00:19:43.400 --> 00:19:44.690
Lei En has tried hard

00:19:44.890 --> 00:19:47.510
for the happiness of people.

00:19:47.720 --> 00:19:49.920
He is the true owner

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:51.420
of the Seven-Star Knives.

00:19:55.070 --> 00:19:56.970
Even if you can fool the judges,

00:19:57.530 --> 00:19:59.360
you can't fool Roger and the Seven-Star Knives.

00:19:59.410 --> 00:20:00.620
This is an indisputable fact.

00:20:01.140 --> 00:20:01.660
Xiang En.

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:04.720
How you used

00:20:04.770 --> 00:20:06.220
the Seven-Star Knives,

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:07.750
can been seen from

00:20:07.790 --> 00:20:08.680
today's result.

00:20:09.780 --> 00:20:12.030
The one who's not qualified to own the Seven-Star Knives

00:20:12.170 --> 00:20:13.500
is actually you, Xiang En.

00:20:21.290 --> 00:20:22.400
The blood on my hand

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:23.900
that has never washed away disappeared.

00:20:24.880 --> 00:20:25.520
Roger.

00:20:26.180 --> 00:20:27.190
I can't believe

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:28.400
you forgave me.

00:20:29.640 --> 00:20:30.640
I swear to you

00:20:31.300 --> 00:20:33.270
I will carry your soul

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:34.870
all my life

00:20:35.140 --> 00:20:36.590
and work hard

00:20:36.640 --> 00:20:38.020
for the happiness of people.

00:20:50.290 --> 00:20:51.910
I'm sorry. I'm really sorry.

00:20:52.400 --> 00:20:53.540
Because of my weakness,

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:55.640
I lost such an important game.

00:20:56.080 --> 00:20:57.050
No, Lei En.

00:20:57.280 --> 00:20:59.190
Thank you for making such delicious food.

00:20:59.720 --> 00:21:00.470
We are so happy

00:21:00.520 --> 00:21:02.300
to see you

00:21:02.390 --> 00:21:03.570
pull yourself together.

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:05.320
Now,

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:07.170
it's Mao's turn.

00:21:07.360 --> 00:21:08.350
Whoever you are,

00:21:08.400 --> 00:21:09.760
just bring it on.

00:21:09.820 --> 00:21:11.090
OK, now the competition result is

00:21:11.140 --> 00:21:12.690
one win, one loss and one draw.

00:21:12.860 --> 00:21:14.600
It's a tie.

00:21:15.140 --> 00:21:16.480
The Competition

00:21:16.720 --> 00:21:19.830
finally goes to Round 4.

00:21:21.320 --> 00:21:21.820
Good.

00:21:22.500 --> 00:21:23.420
It's up to you.

00:21:23.870 --> 00:21:26.010
Who will be my rival?

00:21:26.240 --> 00:21:26.810
Yes.

00:21:27.070 --> 00:21:28.150
Stop being smug.

00:21:28.490 --> 00:21:30.020
Which of you will

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:31.750
compete with Mao?

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:33.350
Don't worry.

00:21:34.210 --> 00:21:36.520
Liu Maoxing, our head

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:38.140
has been waiting for you for a long time.

00:21:38.760 --> 00:21:39.340
Wait for me?

00:23:15.019 --> 00:23:16.979
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.569 --> 00:23:21.013
Now it's time for the final battle of
the Banquet Cuisine Competition.

00:23:21.013 --> 00:23:23.796
I will never let the backstage guys
have the Legendary Cooking Utensils.

00:23:24.107 --> 00:23:26.153
Now, who's my opponent?

00:23:26.301 --> 00:23:27.136
Come on out!

00:23:27.472 --> 00:23:28.999
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.258 --> 00:23:31.861
Demon of Vengeance Shaoan! Conclusion of Destiny

00:23:32.305 --> 00:23:33.540
It will definitely be interesting!
